              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗೃಹಿಣಿ — gṛhiṇi — \"a homemaker; a housewife\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನನ್ನ ಅಮ್ಮ ಗೃಹಿಣಿ, ಮನೆಯ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಕೆಲಸ ನೋಡಿಕೊಳ್ಳುತ್ತಾರೆ. nanna amma gṛhiṇi, maneya ellā kelasa nōḍikoḷḷuttāre. My mother is a homemaker; she looks after all the work of the house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಗೃಹ, a house + -ಇಣಿ, the woman of it."
            }
          ]
        },
