              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜಿ ಅಜ್ಜನ ಐವತ್ತು ವರ್ಷದ ಸಂಗಾತಿ. ajji ajjana aivattu varṣada saṅgāti. Grandmother has been grandfather's partner for fifty years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A life partner, and also a comrade: ಪ್ರಯಾಣದ ಸಂಗಾತಿ (saṅgāti), a travel companion."
            }
          ]
        },
