              "text": "ಗಂಡ ವಿದೇಶಕ್ಕೆ ಹೋದಾಗ ಅವಳಿಗೆ ವಿರಹದ ನೋವು ಆಯಿತು. gaṇḍa vidēśakke hōdāga avaḷige virahada nōvu āyitu. When her husband went abroad, she felt the pain of separation."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A favourite theme of songs and poems."
            }
